# Text files keep LF line ends on every platform. Without this a Windows checkout (Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true,
# and the "Windows app" workflow runs on windows-latest) writes CRLF, and tests that read a source file as text and match across a
# line break fail there (desktop/tests/about.test.ts did), which turns the app's release red.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.mid binary
*.woff2 binary
*.exe binary
